{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a0b5191b341d430b1fea28fe57ccb1f7439e5b2a55e55d5d7640f94a4db4e145", "ja": "みんなを元気に！　笑顔をあなたに！", "zh": "为大家带来元气！为你送上笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "791daf0d904f982b64325c61e2ed220c6676e50f29574e7a558f9c6df07027e5", "ja": "さて、エンディングはお待ちかね、\nアイドル達の新曲披露！\n仲間がいたから、頑張れた……\n仲間がいたから、乗り越えられた……\nみんなの笑顔のため、心を込めて歌います！", "zh": "接下来，终于到了期待已久的结尾——\n偶像们将为大家献上新歌！\n因为有伙伴在身边，才能努力到现在……\n因为有伙伴在身边，才能一路克服困难……\n为了大家的笑容，我们会倾注心意歌唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0beae990ea4402c8a8bfc0e24a735dbdad817650fdddb6f4ef6530d75e66b4ab", "ja": "（長丁場の生放送も、残すはエンディングだ。\n最後まで、気を引き締めていかないとな！）", "zh": "（长时间的直播节目也只剩下最后的结尾了。必须坚持到最后，继续打起精神来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "9533cccfbc58b29edeb39a818d9d5abd9fa3bd5610a931849f21a521d34042a1", "ja": "お疲れさまです、みなさん。\nこれで番組も終わってしまいますね……頑張るぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，大家。\n节目也要到此结束了呢……加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "39e9cef08e56ee5e1cad715e4dde09ca9feb6ad3763b4c5ed1ca537c0176cd11", "ja": "お疲れ様、瑞希。ちゃんと休憩できたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。好好休息过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "d60f243d6c015406b0b5b0f9ae42926fdfce12fbd94e15cf0d2f48f0d07fb284", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\n体調はバッチリです……真壁瑞希、完全復活。", "zh": "是的，{$P$}。\n状态好得很……真壁瑞希，完全复活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "a6d09387012855ba38f94faeee4aebf9d9c8ded3624d159bbcbac0a140fef1b1", "ja": "顔色も良さそうですね。\nきちんと休息がとれたようで、安心いたしました。", "zh": "气色看起来也不错。看来你确实好好休息过了，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8ef0c38a360076f390205de20ff5a009c32c44f5a8eaf5b83d4257e4f00c844", "ja": "まあ、瑞希が寝てる間の撮れ高は、\n私がバッチリもろうたけどな！", "zh": "不过，瑞希睡着的时候，我可是拍到了不少好素材呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "73a900ce435cc9855fb4bb92f69fe0cfbebe3ae7c021c786450bd9fdb29298d0", "ja": "なんと……！　さすがです、横山さん。\n……私も撮れ高に貢献したかった。", "zh": "没想到……！不愧是横山小姐。\n……我也想为拍摄素材贡献一份力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "2a0fcf123005174f5996430ce8e433371f85aaeae567a6bfef32fff0df744bf2", "ja": "あははっ。\n瑞希は、ほんま根っからのエンターテイナーやな！", "zh": "啊哈哈。\n瑞希还真是个天生的娱乐家啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2f607775aab447de09673570ee9d2256349a747c92370dbdf001df825868c229", "ja": "奈緒もだけど、可奈やひなたも大活躍だったな。", "zh": "奈绪也是，不过可奈和日向也都大显身手了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "3da422f3c153d70123d6769530e705e4936bdc0039bf069955f5c3857c5ac35c", "ja": "ええ。野生のばんどと対戦する\n『≡君彩≡』の勇姿は、真、頼もしかったです。", "zh": "是的。『≡君彩≡』与野生乐队对战时的英姿，实在令人安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "34cc706f4736c275fa09037806d2dcf9329504a6d48fda366688cacd299b68d3", "ja": "あれは、恵美さんと亜利沙さんがすごかったんです！\n速弾きと高速スクラッチで相手を圧倒して……。", "zh": "那是因为惠美和亚利沙太厉害了！她们用速弹和高速刮弦压倒了对手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "1da2c52fdc23f1ce15c8646201559dbcda1e78c3deab4b7e35397554dcf2660d", "ja": "私はいつもどおりでいいって言われたので、\nふつうに歌ってただけなんです。えへへっ。", "zh": "他们说我照平时那样就好，所以我只是正常地唱歌而已。诶嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "389df86504c8fd5568d92036d0cc6947f752dbe486de7276364886cfe0814259", "ja": "あたしもおんなじだよぉ。\n美也さんの作戦がなかったら、負けてたかもねぇ。", "zh": "我也一样哦。\n要不是美也小姐的策略，说不定就输了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "5dad12695a51c29187ddbcf371cec5c02b6caa7bef1dccfaa034d44de5966fab", "ja": "確か、ずっと同点で、最終問題で決着したんやったな。\n激アツな展開やけど、美也の仕業やったとは……。", "zh": "好像一直都是平局，最后靠最后一题才分出胜负来着。\n虽然是超燃的发展，但没想到居然是美也搞的鬼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "767d15e91539645d9c2eabbe10ba7cb03fdd46e670a56fa10e45574d65c80a1b", "ja": "『Chrono-Lexica』の機械人形との鬼ごっこも、\n事前収録の映像でしたが、盛り上がっていましたよ。", "zh": "『Chrono-Lexica』与机械人偶的捉迷藏，\n虽然是事先录制的视频，但也十分热闹哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "6368535b46ce6dfb901d5bc15ceee66369689cef4136c8d9c7fbb8359762875a", "ja": "本当ですか？　楽しんでもらえたなら良かったです。\n……あとで配信版で確認しなきゃ。", "zh": "真的吗？能让大家开心就好了。  \n……之后得在播出版里确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "d5e6a90e388d6baf5583c9267bdaebe25ad9efcf3ae32e3c8fc6f27d7544368c", "ja": "でも、こうして番組を楽しめない時間ができたのは、\n私が未熟な証拠です……。", "zh": "可是，像这样出现了无法享受节目的时间，正说明我还不够成熟……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "1c2b50b0e44e9ae892305eda29868cf075bdc8f09d7a89bd980c7a1bed74e405", "ja": "そんなことないです！　瑞希さんが頑張ってたから、\n私も頑張ろう！って思ったんです。", "zh": "才不是那样！正因为瑞希小姐一直在努力，我也才想着“我也要加油！”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "40f03813c7c44839e002c773828f0fc445b1b1ff51712b6315018f8ade9d1d60", "ja": "瑞希さんと一緒だったから、\nあたしも最後まで笑顔でいれたんだよぉ。", "zh": "因为有瑞希小姐陪着我，\n我才能一直笑到最后哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9f70d4991f816f9f74097ee325938e06b6118ec374757518e33d1115260a0bdc", "ja": "お互いの頑張る姿で、みんな頑張れたってことか。\nその番組ももうすぐ終了だ。", "zh": "也就是说，大家都因为看到彼此努力的样子而努力到了最后啊。\n那档节目也快要结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f736b56a6d69da44060e6fd6db92f17da35e7abc7bfeb7cac50a45419a2bd564", "ja": "みんなの歌と笑顔で、番組の最後を締めくくろう！", "zh": "让我们用大家的歌声和笑容，为节目画上句号吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "95674212bdede15f19740c57e080bb00a6f64a4926ca1d884456edfd9a6755d9", "ja": "はい。番組をみているみなさんが、元気になるように。\n私達の精一杯の思いを込めて……。", "zh": "好的。为了让正在收看节目的大家都能打起精神来。\n让我们倾注全力的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "493ff6e475504808fede070200e25c2b428e77cbbd42fbc4963b9d0c2e054a1b", "ja": "せや！\nみんなで円陣組んで、いっちょ気合い入れへん？", "zh": "对了！\n大家一起围成圆阵，打起精神来干一场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "843b708369772ed15f6f8f23c2d608cd95a7a5f6f85bee545c3edad699a608c8", "ja": "わあ～！　いいですね！\n円陣で～、みんなのエンジン全開～♪　なんて。", "zh": "哇～！好主意！\n围成圆阵～让大家的引擎全开～♪什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "abb5ad6df63122f9c3e1485752bfbc5da749e95c83affbc432d50d5cb8f0d179", "ja": "いい案だな。でも、音頭は誰にしようか？", "zh": "是个好主意。不过，让谁来带头喊口号呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "7fda5006baeb02526fe602871cce2a880667a500c2e5198bc7c4b8b1282a4e94", "ja": "貴音でええんとちゃう？　こん中で一番上なんやし。", "zh": "让贵音来不就行了？她可是这里年纪最大的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "940a58f7d1be3528f0caeda632ee5fa5f81fe67699752e1665ee456a85cb3c4c", "ja": "そうですね……。そういう考えもありますが、\n私は瑞希が適任だと思います。", "zh": "是啊……确实也可以这么考虑，\n但我认为瑞希最合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "c6893738f7c83addbc7f5d72e7f108370e8fdae167542125ed6965da27aa8616", "ja": "えっ……。私ですか？", "zh": "咦……是我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "759e475093da44218bc4e4a71e495abaa348fdbd80421a220ed11c6ad33f4077", "ja": "本日の最大の功労者は瑞希ですから。\nその者の言葉であれば、より気合いが入るというもの。", "zh": "今天最大的功臣是瑞希。\n由她来发话，自然更能让人鼓起干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d7f2a4adff51077d523d8a0de0d38f81d0e4e796121f17604aeedb08d0919de1", "ja": "確かに、そうだな。\n瑞希、音頭は任せていいか？", "zh": "确实，说得对。\n瑞希，带头的事就交给你了，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "24a54bf9a54ef9d0030d1d104bd5294ad33756f48f51fa638185e965e8fc2446", "ja": "……はい。任されました、{$P$}。\nそれでは僭越ながら……。", "zh": "……好的。就交给我吧，{$P$}。\n那么恕我冒昧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "121063ec406869797f7619b71bc6c2a1783f22090bf5b7de99ef5caf80d7479e", "ja": "ついに、次の曲でエンディングになります。\nしかしこれは生放送……一発勝負です。", "zh": "终于要在下一首歌结束整场演出了。\n不过这是现场直播……只能一决胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "37aa26f5df016bd9dabe1658a19dc27363cfc54faf6601fc6e172758f12514db", "ja": "こらこら。\n最後にプレッシャーをかけないでくれ……。", "zh": "好了好了。\n最后就别给我施加压力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
